---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="404 - 页面不存在" 
  description="您访问的页面已转移或不存在。为您推荐最核心的网络配置教程与AI工具指南。"
  noindex={true}
>
  <main class="min-h-[80vh] flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-4 py-20 text-center relative overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Background Decor -->
    <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[800px] h-[800px] bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 to-teal-50 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-50 pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>
    
    <div class="mb-8 relative">
      <h1 class="text-[8rem] md:text-[12rem] font-black font-heading leading-none text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500 to-teal-700 tracking-tighter select-none">
        404
      </h1>
      <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-full h-full bg-slate-900/10 backdrop-blur-[2px] rounded-full blur-xl -z-10"></div>
    </div>
    
    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-slate-200 mb-4 font-heading">
      啊哦！这个页面似乎迷路了
    </h2>
    <p class="text-slate-400 mb-12 max-w-md mx-auto">
      您访问的链接可能已失效、被重命名，或者被外星人劫持了。不过别担心，干货都在下面。
    </p>
    
    <div class="w-full max-w-2xl bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl shadow-xl shadow-slate-900/50/50 border border-slate-800 p-8 mb-10 text-left">
      <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-emerald-600 mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z"></path></svg>
        你可能正在寻找这些热门资料：
      </h3>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/category/beginners/" class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-800 border border-transparent hover:border-slate-800 transition-all group">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-emerald-100 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="font-medium text-slate-200">新手教程系列</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5">从零开始配置代理客户端</div>
          </div>
        </a>
        
        <a href="/tag/clash/" class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-800 border border-transparent hover:border-slate-800 transition-all group">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-blue-100 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 3v2m6-2v2M9 19v2m6-2v2M5 9H3m2 6H3m18-6h-2m2 6h-2M7 19h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2zM9 9h6v6H9V9z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="font-medium text-slate-200">Clash 进阶教程</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5">Windows / Mac / Android / iOS</div>
          </div>
        </a>
        
        <a href="/tag/sing-box/" class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-800 border border-transparent hover:border-slate-800 transition-all group">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-purple-50 text-purple-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-purple-100 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M20 7l-8-4-8 4m16 0l-8 4m8-4v10l-8 4m0-10L4 7m8 4v10M4 7v10l8 4"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="font-medium text-slate-200">sing-box 教程</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5">下一代通用代理内核全指南</div>
          </div>
        </a>
        
        <a href="/tag/ai-tools/" class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-800 border border-transparent hover:border-slate-800 transition-all group">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-rose-50 text-rose-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-rose-100 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="font-medium text-slate-200">AI 工具指北</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5">ChatGPT / Claude 解锁与防封</div>
          </div>
        </a>
        
        <a href="/tools/" class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-800 border border-transparent hover:border-slate-800 transition-all group sm:col-span-2">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-slate-800 text-slate-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-slate-200 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="font-medium text-slate-200">极客网络诊断工具</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5">IP 检测 / DNS 泄露检查 / WebRTC 阻断</div>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 w-full max-w-md mx-auto">
      <a href="/" class="flex-1 px-8 py-3.5 bg-emerald-600 text-white font-bold rounded-xl hover:bg-emerald-700 transition-colors shadow-lg shadow-emerald-600/30">
        返回首页
      </a>
      <a href="/blog/" class="flex-1 px-8 py-3.5 bg-slate-900 text-emerald-600 font-bold rounded-xl hover:bg-emerald-50 transition-colors border border-emerald-200 shadow-sm">
        浏览全部文章
      </a>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
